  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "Irregular: *sit, sat, sat*. English separates the movement (*sit down*) from the position (*be sitting*); some languages use one form for both. The preposition depends on the seat: *on a chair*, *in an armchair*.",
